📈 TruSens Z-1000 Air Purifier - If you prefer a more compact solution for smaller rooms, take a closer look at the TruSens Z-1000. Its PureDirect airflow and 360° HEPA and carbon filtration create a comprehensive cleaning experience, complete with UV sterilization for added protection against germs and bacteria. ($$, Perfect for Small Spaces!)

